Package: linscp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: graphical file transfer client
 LinSCP is a noncommercial dual-pane file transfer client. Its native
 desktop application uses Tauri, WebKitGTK, and a Rust transfer engine.
 Protocol support varies by backend and full upstream feature parity is
 not provided.
